{"total_count":1,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563","id":5242614307,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABA5Pcyg","number":5563,"title":"[field][checkbox][switch] Fix controlled blur validation and stale filled state","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619568071,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio6Xxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20switch","name":"component: switch","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the switch component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619647145,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio_MqQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20checkbox","name":"component: checkbox","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the checkbox component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7205061925,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABrXSFJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20field","name":"component: field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the field component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-25T06:04:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T08:56:46Z","closed_at":"2026-08-25T08:47:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/5563","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5563.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-25T08:47:41Z"},"body":"Two field lifecycle fixes. The blur half is a regression from #5460; the filled half predates it.\n\n- **Controlled blur normalization no longer discards validation.** With `validationMode=\"onBlur\"`, a blur handler that normalizes the controlled value (e.g. `.trim()`) had its commit retired by the value's prop transition. The blur handler now re-commits the settled DOM value in a microtask, unless it settled back to the initial value (a programmatic reset stays quiet). Async normalization after blur is still not covered.\n- **`filled` is now derived from the current value** in a layout effect (the `NumberField` pattern) instead of transition callbacks and write-only mount effects. This fixes stale `data-filled` on remounts and custom `render` elements in `Field.Control`, `Checkbox.Root`, and `Switch.Root`, and `CheckboxGroup` now fully owns the filled state.\n\n`dirty` stays transition-driven: deriving it needs mount-time `initialValue` ordering guarantees and interacts with #5345.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5563/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}